{"sourceUrl":"https://ccte.hhu.edu.cn/2025/0627/c6261a304919/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:02.867135+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ccte.hhu.edu.cn/2025/0627/c6261a304919/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><div><p><br/></p></div><p><span><span><strong>河海大学土木与交通学院</strong></span><span><strong>2025</strong></span></span><span><strong>年全国优秀大学生校园</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>开放日及有关安排的通知</strong></span></p><p><span>河海大学土木与交通学院最早可追溯到</span><span><span>1922</span></span><span>年河海工程专门学校设立的“结构部”和“路工学部”，</span><span><span>2009</span></span><span>年组建土木与交通学院。学院土木工程学科为国家一级重点（培育）学科、江苏省一级重点学科、江苏省优势学科建设工程学科（</span><span><span>A</span></span><span>类），在第五轮学科评估位列</span><span><span>A</span></span><span>等，其中岩土工程为国家首批重点学科、结构工程为江苏省重点学科。交通运输工程学科在软科中国大学专业评级</span><span><span>B+</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>学院致力于培养大土木大交通背景下的高级复合型人才。毕业生可到水利、市政、交通、能源或政府机关职能部门从事管理、科研、规划、审计等工作。近年来，河海土木院毕业生始终保持</span><span>97.5%</span></span><span><span>以上的高就业率，</span><span>80%</span></span><span>以上毕业生前往行业重点单位就业，在行业内发挥重要作用，深受社会欢迎。</span></p><p><span><span>为让更多优秀考生更深入地了解我院特色与优势，各学科实力、师资力量、研究生教育情况和研究生招生信息等，我院将于</span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span><span>日</span><span>-</span><span>7</span></span><span>日期间举办校园开放日活动。活动期间，我院将进行研究生招生政策宣讲、与导师面对面交流互动等活动，提供详尽的报考信息和指导。欢迎有意向报考我院研究生的同学前来参加，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></p><p><span><strong>一、活动规模及活动对象</strong></span></p><p><span>本次活动规模拟定</span><span>150</span><span>名左右，具体专业详见报名系统，报名条件如下：</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span>高水平大学或设有特色专业全日制高校的本科三年级在校生（</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>届毕业生）。</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>有意来河海大学求学深造，对所报专业有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事相关学术研究或实践工作。</span></p><p><span><strong>二、报名时间及方式</strong></span></p><p><span>请有意向申请我院（系）校园开放日的同学于北京时间</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span><span><span>2</span><span>7</span></span></span><span>日</span><span><span><span>12</span><span>:00—2025</span></span></span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span><span><span><span>12</span><span>:00</span></span></span><span><span>，</span><span>在河海大学研究</span><span>生招生管理系统（考生端）（</span></span><span><a href=\"http://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/</a></span><span>）中，招生项目选择“全国优秀大学生校园开放日”进行注册、登录和信息填报（具体操作详见系统提示），不在规定时间内填报的所有报名信息均无效。</span></p><p><span><strong>三、材料提交与确认</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>参加我院（系）校园开放日的同学，需提供以下材料</span><span><strong>（</strong></span><span><strong>请按照顺序扫描成</strong></span></span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span><span><strong>文件，汇总生成一个压缩包，命名方式：报名专业</strong></span><span><strong>_</strong></span><span><strong>报名姓名</strong></span><span><strong>_</strong></span><span><strong>校园开放日报名材料</strong></span><span><strong>.ZIP</strong></span><span><span><strong>，上传至报名系统）</strong></span><span>，并携带材料纸质版报到。</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>）“</span><span><span>2025</span></span><span>年全国优秀大学生校园开放日报名登记表”</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份（请至报名系统生成和下载）。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>）身份证、学生证复印件。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>）前两年半成绩单与总评成绩、排名证明</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>）学术或科研成果、各类获奖证书扫描件各</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>）国家英语四、六级考试成绩，或</span><span><span>IELTS/TOEFL</span></span><span>成绩，或</span><span><span>GRE/GMAT</span></span><span>成绩等体现自身外语水平的证明材料</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>我院将对提交的报名信息进行审核后确定入围开放日活动对象。请提交报名申请的同学于北京时间</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span><span><span><span>1</span><span>7</span><span>:00</span></span></span><span><span>前登录报名系统查询审核状态，</span><span>入围者请于北京时间</span></span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日</span><span><span><span>15</span><span>:00</span></span></span><span>时前，在报名系统中点击确认参加，逾期未确认参加者视作放弃。</span></p><p><span><strong>四、活动方式及具体安排</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>1. </strong></span><span>活动形式：现场参加，不收取任何费用</span></p><p><span><strong>2. </strong></span><span>报到时间：</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span><span>日</span><span>15:00</span></span><span><span>～</span><span>18:00 </span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span>报到地点：河海大学西康路校区科学馆</span><span><span>510</span></span><span>（校内学生）</span></p><p><span>隽恒酒店大厅（校外学生）</span></p><p><span><span><span>4. </span><span>7</span></span></span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日活动内容：</span></p><ol><li><p><span>学院开幕式</span></p></li><li><p><span>学院及学科介绍</span></p></li><li><p><span>各研究所介绍</span></p></li><li><p><span>专家学术讲座</span></p></li><li><p><span>教授名师面对面交流</span></p></li><li><p><span>学生代表交流</span></p></li></ol><p><span>具体日程安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span><strong>五、其他</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>其他未尽事宜请参见学院（系）官网通知，最终招生学院、专业、方向和导师以</span><span>2026</span></span><span>年博士、硕士研究生招生简章和专业目录公布信息为准。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>开放日待遇： </span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>）差旅、食宿：</span></p><p><span>提供校园开放日期间在南京的食宿（</span><span>外地学生提供</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span>日晚上的住宿，</span><span>本校和南京本地学生住宿交通自理），</span><span>凡是参加我院校园开放日，后续推免或者一志愿被我院录取的外校应届考生，给予</span><span>一定的</span><span>往返</span><span>交通</span><span>补贴</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span></span><span>）保险：将为参加校园开放日的同学购买开放日</span><span>期</span><span>间人身意外伤害保险。</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>联系方式：</span></p><p><span>联系人：</span><span>夏老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>025-83786634</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>hhutmyyz@163.com</span></p><p><span>通信地址：</span><span><span>南京市鼓楼区西康路</span><span>1</span></span><span>号河海大学土木与交通</span></p><p><span>学院</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>土木与交通学院</span></p><p><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span><span>27</span></span><span>日</span></p><div><p><span></span></p><p><span>第 <span>4</span> 页 共 <span>4</span> 页</span></p><br/><p><br/></p></div><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e013e96687103991e93611563e2d76ec4bca97828b3389d5e72ee765118169f8","textLength":1685,"sourceSha256":"848bec31565b4e0d1752a39bec95d543bb7533ed9836b0f4359cc3f6a6bf3ec2","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0d1a2b96cfde4bbebbe7","title":"2025年河海大学土木与交通学院2025年全国优秀大学生校园开放日及有关安排的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:02.867135+00:00"}
